      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on an article about how AI is going to wipe out most middle-class jobs in the next decade. I want to make a strong case for why Universal Basic Income is basically the only viable solution we have to prevent a total societal collapse. Can you outline the most convincing arguments for why UBI is the only way to handle this coming job crisis?",
