      "content": "Universal Basic Income is the only viable solution because it acknowledges the inevitable displacement of jobs by AI, while also addressing the growing wealth gap and social unrest that will inevitably follow. By providing a guaranteed minimum income, UBI ensures that everyone has a basic standard of living, regardless of their employment status, thereby reducing poverty and inequality. This, in turn, will foster a more stable and resilient society, where people are free to pursue meaningful work and contribute to the economy in ways that AI cannot replicate. UBI is the only solution that prioritizes human dignity and well-being over the interests of corporations and the wealthy elite.",
